not prove memoization is safe; context, mutation and exceptions require separate review.',\n        'No inputs, results or health records are exported. No caching or production modification.']}\nPath('/tmp/reva-phase5-semantic-calls.json').write_text(json.dumps(summary, indent=2)+'\\n')\nraise SystemExit(code)\n",
